cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "EMMA-MIX workflow: from a CSV table to EMMA-MIX mixing ratios and their uncertainty"
version: "1.0.0"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23698139
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/RomiGeo/EMMA-MIX-workflow"
abstract: >-
  Python scripts to build the input file (.prn) of the EMMA-MIX (MIX) program
  from a CSV table of concentrations, and to compute the first-order
  uncertainty of the mixing ratios from the MIX output (.res).
keywords:
  - end-member mixing analysis
  - EMMA
  - MIX
  - mixing ratios
  - uncertainty
  - hydrograph separation
  - hydrochemistry
